# Files `quarto use template rameliaz/quarto-unair-theme` should NOT copy into
# a new project. Only the extension itself (_extensions/) and example.qmd are
# meant to be copied; Quarto already skips dotfiles, README and LICENSE.
# _quarto.yml only configures this repo's GitHub Pages demo: its
# `output-file: index.html` would send every deck in a user's project to the
# same file, and its `render` list would build only example.qmd.
_quarto.yml
unair_corporate_branding/
.github/
.claude/
docs/
img/
pptx/
skills/
CHANGELOG.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
QUICKSTART.md
README.md
AGENTS.md
